# DESIGN NOTES (owner, 5 Oct 2026) - NOTE ONLY, NOT BUILT
## Game states (the basis of the sim)
1. LIVE = just the game.
2. PAUSED.
3. EDIT / BUILD = something in the game world is being edited. Tools get appended here.
4. SELECT = identify anything in view: inspect, export, see what it links to. Paired with the INTIMATE INTERACTION MENU (vital mechanic).
   Entity version of Select lives in LIVE mode: dissection, needs, social check-in, live inspection of game data. Comes AFTER the game works and the school project is done.
## Build-mode UI
- The revolver is the home of all tiled menus in the game. Build is the exception: it needs special tools, so it may have its own UI.
- Transform GIZMO (Move / Rotate / Scale, the sphere-layout gizmo) can be deployed from the Build menu, ON SCREEN BY DEFAULT, and is only visible while EDIT is active. Append the transform tool there.
- Wanted: toggle between ball (geometry) view and mesh view while in Build/Edit/Select. Toggle between edit / transform / rotate gizmos.
- Do NOT change the existing revolver state or its six bullets.
